  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Three identical resistors with resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and two identical inductors with sell inductance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math> are connected to an ideal battery with emf of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> as shown in figure. The current through the battery long after the switch has been closed will be________<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5974ef8d-c2c7-4182-8b8c-16b222d64620-9894442.PNG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 231px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5974ef8d-c2c7-4182-8b8c-16b222d64620-9894442.PNG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 231px;\" /></p><p>We know that after long time an inductor offers&nbsp;zero resistance i.e., in steady state condition.</p><p>Here all three identical&nbsp;resistors are in parallel, so equivalent resistance is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Now, current through the battery is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
